microduck-viewer
================

This project embeds and adapts third-party material. Attribution and license
terms follow.

Robot model, meshes, and MJCF
-----------------------------
  Source : https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Files  : assets/microduck.glb, assets/robot_allcollisions.xml,
           assets/meshes/*.stl

Trained RL locomotion policy
----------------------------
  Source : https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Note   : The original checkpoint (BEST_alpha_walking.onnx, a plain MLP with an
           input normalizer) was re-exported without modification of its weights
           to a raw float32 blob (assets/policy.bin + assets/policy.meta.json)
           so it can run in plain JavaScript without onnxruntime. The observation
           layout, action scaling, and control interface are unchanged.

Reference implementation
------------------------
  The browser sim loop (observation construction, floor/keyframe injection,
  GLB→render mesh mapping) was adapted from the reference web app
  https://huggingface.co/spaces/pollen-robotics/microduck-simulator
  (physics/policy interface documented therein). Adapted, not copied verbatim.

